Block 1 >	size: 0	align: 2	alloc type: 0	alive: true	address: 8

Target:
i64 %#1 = poison
ptr %#2 = poison
ptr %arrayidx2 = poison
Source value: pointer(non-local, block_id=0, offset=3) / Address=#x0000000000000003
Target value: poison

Summary:
  0 correct transformations
  1 incorrect transformations
  0 failed-to-prove transformations
  0 Alive2 errors

